  "title": {
    "en": "WSTKeQing2677 · DSH plugins",
    "zh": "WSTKeQing2677 的 DSH 插件"
  },
  "description": {
    "en": "Three small DSH plugins: fold long tool output, copy a whole turn, and watch the remaining context. All three are tested on DSH 0.2.1-rc.5 / Windows x64 / Web UI only, and install from pinned Git commits (no npm release).",
    "zh": "三个 DSH 小插件：折叠长工具输出、整回合复制、上下文余量读数。三个都只在 DSH 0.2.1-rc.5 / Windows x64 / Web UI 上验证过，安装的是固定 commit 的 Git 检出（未发 npm）。"
  },
