    {
      "name": "dsh-full-copy",
      "title": {
        "en": "Full Copy",
        "zh": "完全复制"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Adds one \"Copy full turn\" action above the reply action row: copies the turn's reasoning, response, and tool-call summaries as a single Markdown document. Limits: verified only on DSH 0.2.1-rc.5 · Windows x64 · Web UI; installed from a pinned Git commit (no npm release); not yet tested on macOS or Linux.",
        "zh": "每条回复上方加一个「完全复制」：把该回合的思考、正文与工具调用摘要复制成一段 Markdown。 限制：仅在 DSH 0.2.1-rc.5 · Windows x64 · Web UI 上验证；安装的是固定 commit 的 Git 检出（未发 npm）；尚未在 macOS / Linux 测试。"
      },
