    {
      "name": "dsh-context-meter",
      "title": {
        "en": "Context Meter",
        "zh": "上下文余量"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Keeps one compact reading in the composer: how far the auto-compaction threshold and the hard context limit still are, with five bands that say when to start a new session. Limits: verified only on DSH 0.2.1-rc.5 · Windows x64 · Web UI; installed from a pinned Git commit (no npm release); not yet tested on macOS or Linux.",
        "zh": "输入框内常驻一行：距自动压缩、距上下文硬上限还剩多少；五档提示何时该开新会话。 限制：仅在 DSH 0.2.1-rc.5 · Windows x64 · Web UI 上验证；安装的是固定 commit 的 Git 检出（未发 npm）；尚未在 macOS / Linux 测试。"
      },
